description:
Server-side replication of the Google Earth Engine MOD11A1 monthly LST pipeline. Loads the raw daily MODIS Terra cube (modis_lst_daily: lst_day + qc_day), quality-masks and converts to degrees Celsius (modis_lst_day_celsius), takes the monthly median (aggregate_temporal_period), fills small gaps with an iterated focal mean (focal_fill), and publishes the result as a monthly GeoZarr dataset.

The output_dataset_id must have a registered dataset template on the instance (sync: {kind: static} with a display block). Run as a batch job (Zarr output is batch-only):

{
  "m": {
    "process_id": "modis_lst_monthly",
    "arguments": {
      "dataset_id": "modis_lst_daily",
      "output_dataset_id": "modis_lst_day_monthly_oeo",
      "variable": "lst_day",
      "temporal_extent": ["2016-01-01", "2016-12-31"]
    },
    "result": true
  }
}
